{"symbol":"GNS.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:50:34Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Sienna 75","city":"Warsaw","zip":"00-833","country":"Poland","phone":"48 45 112 3396","website":"https://gnsa.com","industry":"Electronic Gaming & Multimedia","industryKey":"electronic-gaming-multimedia","industryDisp":"Electronic Gaming & Multimedia","sector":"Communication Services","sectorKey":"communication-services","sectorDisp":"Communication Services","longBusinessSummary":"Niewiadów Polska Grupa Militarna S.A. operates in the defense sector in Poland and the European Union. The company engages in the production of military products; development of modern drones, including unmanned aerial vehicles (UAV) under the ReconSky name, unmanned ground vehicles (UGVs) under the ReconPatrol name, and unmanned surface vessels (USVs) under the ReconSea name; and operation of a research and development center for testing applications. It also provides ammunition components, such as mortar and artillery rounds in calibers; mines and engineering equipment; transportation services; ammunition, such as rifles; weapons and combat equipment; product testing and backpack assembly services; dual-use products; military logistics services, including specialized warehouses; modern technologies for the military; and comprehensive consulting and training services. The company serves the Polish army. The companyw as formerly known as Grupa Niewiadów - PGM S.A and changed its name to Niewiadów Polska Grupa Militarna S.A. in December 2025. Niewiadów Polska Grupa Militarna S.A. is headquartered in Warsaw, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":68,"companyOfficers":[],"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":14.05,"open":14,"dayLow":13.75,"dayHigh":14,"regularMarketPreviousClose":14.05,"regularMarketOpen":14,"regularMarketDayLow":13.75,"regularMarketDayHigh":14,"dividendYield":0,"payoutRatio":0,"volume":89035,"regularMarketVolume":89035,"averageVolume":189654,"averageVolume10days":15862